URDF and YAML Integration
URDF 
The robot model should describe the robot’s physical structure, links, joints, coordinate frames and relevant joint limits.
If ros2_control is selected, the model can also contain ros2_control hardware declarations, command interfaces, state interfaces and the hardware plugin configuration.
The model must reflect the actual drive and arm joints. 
YAML
